        {
          "code": "wish_conditional_buff",
          "detail": "Effect1038019 adds BUFF21260020 -> BASE2126002(order126) with [3],[21290010],[1],[99],[1] -> BUFF21290010 -> BASE2129001(order129). Enum126/129 are only BFT_O_TWEENTYSIX/BFT_O_TWEENTYNINE; integer-list schema supplies no trigger/target/duration meanings. Ignoring this chain or guessing opcode semantics would make wish execution incomplete."
        },
        {
          "code": "wish_limited_uses_and_cd_transition",
          "detail": "Description and BATTLE_ITEM_CONF104002 establish two uses, PlayerMagicConf.round=3 and SKILL_CONF.cd_round=[4,0], while BAG_ITEM_CONF.initial_use_times=99. Initialization, decrements, recharge and legal-turn timing require the magic_op_info/itemData transition, not treating any raw field as a universal cost/CD."
        },
        {
          "code": "magic_cleanup_and_cast_moment",
          "detail": "Shared effect1004027 removes BUFF20990010/20990020 with cast_moment=6 while primary results use cast_moment=10. Their event-domain ordering and cleanup are not adapted."
        },
        {
          "code": "magic_action_server_protocol",
